CTAN TEX-ARCHIVE
https://ctan.org/tex-archive/

FUNDAMENTALS
  Name     : Comprehensive TeX Archive Network
  Role     : Authoritative public tree for TeX / LaTeX material
  Root     : /tex-archive/
  Use      : Source for TeX Live, MiKTeX, and worldwide mirrors
  Nature   : Directory tree + catalogue, not a single installer

TYPES (top-level categories)
  macros      TeX / LaTeX formats and packages
              (latex, plain, context, xetex, luatex, generic)
  fonts       METAFONT fonts and external font support
  graphics    Drawing and graphics systems
  systems     Engines and distributions by platform
  language    Hyphenation and language support
  info        Manuals, FAQs, documentation
  support     Editors, tools, utilities
  biblio      Bibliography systems
  indexing    Index generation
  dviware     DVI drivers and previewers
  install     Ready-to-install TDS zip packages
  obsolete    Retired / historical material
  usergrps    TeX user group information
  web         Literate-programming tools
  help        Catalogue and direct assistance

VARIABLES / KEY FILES AT ROOT
  CTAN.sites         list of main nodes and active mirrors
  FILES.byname       full file index (large)
  FILES.byname.gz    compressed full index
  FILES.last07days   files changed in last 7 days
  README.mirrors     mirror notes
  README.structure   tree structure notes
  README.uploads     upload guidance

OPERATING NOTES
  Browse   : directory listing on the web interface
  Search   : package catalogue at ctan.org
  Install  : usually via TeX Live / MiKTeX, not raw tree
  Contribute : package uploads accepted at core CTAN nodes
